# 2. Create Wedding

After login, user can create a wedding.

Minimum information:

- Bride name
- Groom name
- Wedding date
- Wedding slug

Example:

```text
lovoria.my.id/w/azis-ida
```

A newly created wedding starts as:

```text
DRAFT
```

User can configure the wedding without paying.

